Developed by a woman for women with privacy in mind, Azallea empowers you to track your Menstrual Cycle, Period, Ovulation and Pregnancy.

● Start tracking your body's natural rhythm without submitting personal information. No registration is required;
● Your data always belongs to you, and only you. You have full control — your data is stored in a local database on your phone and never leaves it;
● Track your Period and get predictions about your Ovulation day and next Menstrual cycle;
● Control who can access your data through an authentication mechanism, including biometric authentication;
● Receive notifications about an upcoming Period and Ovulation day.
● Pregnancy Calendar. Information for your pregnancy week-by-week development. Notification for start of new gestational week. 

Learn what motivated us to create a privacy-first Period Tracker Application at: https://azallea.app.

If you have any questions, issues with the app, or a feature request, contact us at: hello@azallea.app.
